  in  "| — | B1-G1 a | w | done |\n| ~~low~~ | B1-G2 b | w | done |\n| 7 | B1-G3 c | w | pending |\n| 7 | B1-G4 d | w | done |\n| — | B1-G5 e | pending |\n"
  out empty=false n=5 | kind=2 line=1 id="" block="" pending=false text="" cell="B1-G1 a" source="" | kind=2 line=2 id="" block="" pending=false text="" cell="B1-G2 b" source="" | kind=1 line=3 id="B1-G3" block="1" pending=true text="c" cell="" source="" | kind=2 line=4 id="" block="" pending=false text="" cell="B1-G4 d" source="" | kind=3 line=5 id="" block="" pending=false text="" cell="" source="| — | B1-G5 e | pending |"
